  "changes": [
    "Gelato's upgrade map now starts at bottom-center Feed 1 and rises along two independent mixed upgrade routes on the arms of a U-shaped hyperbola. All 62 family/tier identities remain intact.",
    "Gelato uses a new square U-garden illustration and per-area world bounds; Bakery keeps its existing 120-degree upgrade arc and background. The retired Gelato arc artwork is excluded from the APK.",
    "Settings > Developer settings includes Infinite money for the current area. It permits eligible upgrade purchases without spending the real wallet; bought upgrades stay saved and the area-specific toggle resets on restart.",
    "Gelato aim now solves the gravity-affected launch trajectory so unobstructed balls reach the reachable finger target at the normal launch speed.",
    "A curved dotted preview follows the solved flight and ends at the target or the first peg contact; both Twin launchers use a shared reachable target.",
    "Initial Gelato launcher jitter is removed, and free flight uses exact gravity integration so actual shots match the displayed trajectory.",
    "Retains trajectory and Gelato Trial rules revision 2 from v0.6.7. Only pre-revision-2 Gelato Trial times are cleared during migration; current Trial records and campaign progress remain.",
    "Home menu > Settings > Developer settings bypasses Bakery completion and the Gelato entry fee in developer/debug builds.",
    "An unvisited area starts at tray 1 with zero coins and no upgrades; returning restores its own wallet, upgrades, tray progress and Gelato Twin/Power state across restarts.",
    "Bakery and Gelato use Bronze/Silver/Gold/Diamond strength bands at 6/12/18/24 ordinary-peg HP across trays 1-3/4-6/7-9/10-12.",
    "Gelato uses a top-center downward finger-aimed launcher, gravity, twelve fan layouts and its own economy tuning.",
    "Gelato Twin launchers reset Power once; lost Power nodes remain red and can be rebuilt at higher prices with stronger gains while other upgrades remain.",
    "The export explicitly includes data/gelato_economy.json alongside every current top-level runtime JSON file.",
    "Includes the current canonical sugarfall_save.json migration, confirmed Reset progress, Mabel introduction, countdown feedback and result comparison UI."
  ],
  "update_compatibility": "Same Android preview package and development signing certificate as v0.6.7, with version code increased from 17 to 18. Install over the existing preview to retain package-private app data. Campaign money, upgrades and area progress remain. Gelato's U map preserves existing family/tier identities. Gameplay fingerprint inputs, checkpoint schema and Trial schema are unchanged from v0.6.7. Infinite money is an area-specific runtime flag, resets on restart and does not replace the saved wallet. Physical Android installation remains for user testing.",
  "monetization": "Local test service; no real ad or purchase accounts connected",
